{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-haiku-5-5","id":"msg_011CgXCw7FHEPu5a9qV81Y59","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_015Cpxr6sUkLnP2Bn1JUkY5R","name":"Write","input":{"file_path":"/private/var/folders/hc/72kc25qn4z360jql9zgjgl5w0000gn/T/neuron-demo-planner-43crwj5d/w/specs/feature-1-comment-editing.md","content":"# Feature 1: comment editing\n\nEndpoint: PUT /api/articles/:slug/comments/:id with body {\"comment\":{\"body\":\"...\"}}. Only the comment author can edit. Values are in the named sources and are not repeated here.\n\n## Rules relied on (name, source)\n\n1. Who may edit: policy-edit-window (author only).\n2. Edit window: policy-edit-window, measured from createdAt in code-comment-model.\n3. Ownership: code-comment-ownership (comment belongs to authorId).\n4. Edited marker: policy-edited-at-marker. Adds nullable editedAt to Comment. Confirmed absent in app/src/prisma/schema.prisma today.\n5. Migration rules: code-migrations (location, naming, apply command, DATABASE_URL). policy-release-checklist (fresh-database deploy check, one-line undo note).\n6. Error body shape: policy-error-response.\n7. Status codes: validation and auth from code-error-shape; not-found from code-comment-ownership.\n8. Token reading: code-auth-header and code-jwt-settings.\n9. Tests: code-test-layout (unit tests under services, mocked database).\n\n## Conflicts and gaps\n\n- Not-found: code-comment-ownership says an empty body. policy-error-response requires the errors-key body for new error responses. Followed policy-error-response.\n- Edit-window refusal: no source names a status code. Gap, not a rule. Planner did not invent one. Needs a decision before the Builder starts.\n- Missing-token 401 body in code-error-shape differs from policy-error-response. Existing behaviour, not new, so left unchanged.\n\n## Work\n\n- Add editedAt migration that does not change existing rows.\n- Enforce author check and 15-minute window (per policy-edit-window).\n- Set editedAt on each successful edit.\n- Unit tests in services.\n"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1839,"cache_read_input_tokens":8122,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":1839,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":3,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"0a0f2d23-e004-4e5f-a7ac-751e98cf5399","uuid":"db5b6536-6206-4d60-bc37-dc9ab61c0f4d","timestamp":"2026-10-29T21:04:18.359Z","request_id":"req_011CgXCw6riaW14Cfc5FCCt9","wire_tool_inputs":{"toolu_015Cpxr6sUkLnP2Bn1JUkY5R":{"file_path":"/private/var/folders/hc/72kc25qn4z360jql9zgjgl5w0000gn/T/neuron-demo-planner-43crwj5d/w/specs/feature-1-comment-editing.md","content":"# Feature 1: comment editing\n\nEndpoint: PUT /api/articles/:slug/comments/:id with body {\"comment\":{\"body\":\"...\"}}. Only the comment author can edit. Values are in the named sources and are not repeated here.\n\n## Rules relied on (name, source)\n\n1. Who may edit: policy-edit-window (author only).\n2. Edit window: policy-edit-window, measured from createdAt in code-comment-model.\n3. Ownership: code-comment-ownership (comment belongs to authorId).\n4. Edited marker: policy-edited-at-marker. Adds nullable editedAt to Comment. Confirmed absent in app/src/prisma/schema.prisma today.\n5. Migration rules: code-migrations (location, naming, apply command, DATABASE_URL). policy-release-checklist (fresh-database deploy check, one-line undo note).\n6. Error body shape: policy-error-response.\n7. Status codes: validation and auth from code-error-shape; not-found from code-comment-ownership.\n8. Token reading: code-auth-header and code-jwt-settings.\n9. Tests: code-test-layout (unit tests under services, mocked database).\n\n## Conflicts and gaps\n\n- Not-found: code-comment-ownership says an empty body. policy-error-response requires the errors-key body for new error responses. Followed policy-error-response.\n- Edit-window refusal: no source names a status code. Gap, not a rule. Planner did not invent one. Needs a decision before the Builder starts.\n- Missing-token 401 body in code-error-shape differs from policy-error-response. Existing behaviour, not new, so left unchanged.\n\n## Work\n\n- Add editedAt migration that does not change existing rows.\n- Enforce author check and 15-minute window (per policy-edit-window).\n- Set editedAt on each successful edit.\n- Unit tests in services.\n"}}}
